1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,107
Every Moon and Mars mission needs a place on Earth to test.

2
00:00:04,107 --> 00:00:07,206
But the famous analogs are already studied to death.

3
00:00:07,206 --> 00:00:15,089
ROAMER scores thirty-four sites on one five hundred metre grid, shows where the analogy breaks, and ranks them by research gap.

4
00:00:15,089 --> 00:00:18,852
Atacama passes, but scores zero: already studied.

5
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:20,089
Pokhara fails.

6
00:00:20,089 --> 00:00:21,326
Chhusang leads.

7
00:00:21,326 --> 00:00:22,780
Find the Moon on Earth.

8
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,954
Prove it with data.

